    {
      "text": "If  <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math>  and  <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> , then the heat supplied to the gas is  <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>17</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math>",
